  {
   "id": "zmo_03",
   "speaker": "zhoubo",
   "expression": "default",
   "text": "竹林里来了个叫厉横的恶汉，拦路截人，村里没人敢进山。",
   "locKey": "dlg.zmo_03",
   "source": "new-pending-review",
   "conditions": [],
   "next": "zmo_04",
   "setFlags": {},
   "effects": [],
   "dialogue": "zhou_main_offer"
  },
  {
   "id": "zmo_04",
   "speaker": "zhoubo",
   "expression": "default",
   "text": "你若遇上，替我们把他赶走，回来同我说一声。",
   "locKey": "dlg.zmo_04",
   "source": "new-pending-review",
   "conditions": [],
   "choices": [
    {
     "id": "zmo_04_c1",
     "text": "交给我。",
     "locKey": "dlg.zmo_04_c1",
     "next": "zmo_06",
     "conditions": [],
     "source": "new-pending-review"
    },
    {
     "id": "zmo_04_c2",
     "text": "那人什么来路？",
     "locKey": "dlg.zmo_04_c2",
     "next": "zmo_05",
     "conditions": [],
     "source": "new-pending-review"
    }
   ],
   "setFlags": {},
   "effects": [],
   "dialogue": "zhou_main_offer"
  },
  {
   "id": "zmo_05",
   "speaker": "zhoubo",
   "expression": "default",
   "text": "他砍两刀便要蓄一回力，见他握紧刀柄，下一刀就是重的。",
   "locKey": "dlg.zmo_05",
   "source": "gameplay-spec-5-pending-review",
   "conditions": [],
   "next": "zmo_06",
   "setFlags": {},
   "effects": [],
   "dialogue": "zhou_main_offer"
  },
  {
   "id": "zmo_06",
   "speaker": "shenyan",
   "expression": "smile",
   "text": "放心，我去去就回。",
   "locKey": "dlg.zmo_06",
   "source": "new-pending-review",
   "conditions": [],
